{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"B\n    \n      Overlay-Based Lock + Widget Wrapper\n      Lock screen as a full-screen overlay above the MaterialApp. Each amount widget wrapped in a MaskedAmount widget that checks privacy state.\n      \n        \n          Pros\n          \n            Lock is independent of routing — no redirect logic changes\n            Overlay can't be bypassed by any route\n            MaskedAmount widget is explicit — clear what's masked\n          \n        \n        \n          Cons\n          \n            Overlay management is tricky (lifecycle, state restoration)\n            Doesn't follow existing patterns in the app\n            Wrapper widgets add verbosity to every amount display","choice":"b","id":null,"timestamp":1775784998681}
