{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"A\n    \n      Router-Level Lock + Global State\n      Recommended\n      Lock screen injected via GoRouter redirect logic. Privacy masking as a global Riverpod provider that all amount widgets read from.\n      \n        \n          Pros\n          \n            Follows existing patterns (GoRouter redirects already handle auth)\n            Lock screen is a route — clean back-button handling\n            Single privacy provider — all screens react automatically\n            PIN stored in flutter_secure_storage (encrypted)\n            Biometrics via local_auth package\n          \n        \n        \n          Cons\n          \n            Router redirect logic gets more complex\n            Need to ensure lock screen can't be skipped via deep links","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1775785001543}
