{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"C\n    \n      Hybrid — Router Lock + CurrencyFormatter Masking\n      Lock screen via GoRouter (like A). But instead of wrapper widgets, masking is built directly into CurrencyFormatter — when privacy mode is on, format() returns ****. Zero changes to existing screens.\n      \n        \n          Pros\n          \n            Lock screen follows existing router patterns\n            Masking is automatic — every amount already goes through CurrencyFormatter\n            No wrapper widgets, no screen-by-screen changes\n            Smallest code footprint by far\n          \n        \n        \n          Cons\n          \n            CurrencyFormatter becomes context-aware (needs access to provider state)\n            Some amounts might not go through the formatter (edge cases)","choice":"c","id":null,"timestamp":1775785005770}
